<p>It seems like I'm not using the mock correctly, but I went off the <a href="https://github.com/pulumi/examples/blob/master/testing-unit-go/main_test.go" rel="nofollow noreferrer">example here</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.pulumi.com/docs/guides/testing/unit/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Further Docs here</a></p>
